        <section class="faith-topic-group" id="doc-edwards-resolutions">
          <header class="faith-topic-group-header">
            <p class="eyebrow">1722–1723</p>
            <h2 class="section-heading"><em>Resolutions</em></h2>
            <p class="faith-topic-group-author"><em>Jonathan Edwards</em></p>
          </header>
          <ol class="faith-topic-row-list">
            
            <li class="faith-topic-row">
              <a href="/the-faith-received/edwards-resolutions/#resolution-13" class="faith-topic-row-link">
                <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Resolution 13</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">13. Resolved, to be endeavoring to find out fit objects of charity and liberality.</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="faith-topic-row">
              <a href="/the-faith-received/edwards-resolutions/#resolution-14" class="faith-topic-row-link">
                <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Resolution 14</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">14. Resolved, never to do anything out of revenge.</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="faith-topic-row">
              <a href="/the-faith-received/edwards-resolutions/#resolution-16" class="faith-topic-row-link">
                <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Resolution 16</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">16. Resolved, never to speak evil of anyone, so that it shall tend to his dishonor, more or less, upon no account except for some real good.</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="faith-topic-row">
              <a href="/the-faith-received/edwards-resolutions/#resolution-31" class="faith-topic-row-link">
                <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Resolution 31</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">31. Resolved, never to say anything at all against anybody, but when it is perfectly agreeable to the highest degree of Christian honor, and of love to mankind,…</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="faith-topic-row">
              <a href="/the-faith-received/edwards-resolutions/#resolution-38" class="faith-topic-row-link">
                <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Resolution 38</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">38. Resolved, never to speak anything that is ridiculous, sportive, or matter of laughter on the Lord’s day. Sabbath evening, Dec. 23, 1722.</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>

            <li class="faith-topic-row">
              <a href="/the-faith-received/edwards-resolutions/#resolution-47" class="faith-topic-row-link">
                <span class="faith-topic-row-label">Resolution 47</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-snippet">47. Resolved, to endeavor to my utmost to deny whatever is not most agreeable to a good, and universally sweet and benevolent, quiet, peace able, contented, eas…</span>
                <span class="faith-topic-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ol>
